{"ID":"20240205153846-vlwbmfg","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153846-vlwbmfg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153846-vlwbmfg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206085100-724obmx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611151758-svjr22c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2130,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206085100-724obmx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"175黄芩","type":"doc","updated":"20240814190810"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206085100-724obmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085100-724obmx","updated":"20240206085108"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产内蒙古、山西、河北、辽宁等地。\n【性状】\t该品呈圆锥形，扭曲，长825cm，直径13cm。表面棕黄色或深黄色，有稀疏的疣状细根痕，上部较粗糙，有扭曲的纵皱或不规则的网纹，下部有顺纹和细皱。质硬而脆，易折断，断面黄色，中间红棕色，通称子芩，以清火养阴为主；老根中间呈暗棕色或棕黑色，枯朽状或已成空洞，称枯芩，以清火败毒为主。气微，味苦。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清热燥湿，泻火解毒，止血，安胎，降血压。用于湿温、暑温胸闷呕恶，湿热痞满，泻痢，黄疸，肺热咳嗽，高热烦渴，血热吐衄，痈肿疮毒，胎动不安。\n【炙品】\t酒黄芩：取黄芩片，照酒炙法炒干。该品为类圆形或不规则形薄片，外表皮棕褐色，切面黄棕色，呈放射状纹理，略带焦斑，中心部分有的呈棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240206085059-7tovw61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206085059-7tovw61","updated":"20240206085059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206085059-5n0qgdz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205155703-ocsjf7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205155703-ocsjf7f","updated":"20240205155703"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芩-20240205155703-e7nyuhq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 369px;","style":"width: 359px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芩2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芩2-20240205155703-t7opour.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 359px;\" parent-style=\"width: 369px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814184543-jlxul2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814184543-jlxul2b","updated":"20240814185137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 329px;","style":"width: 319px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芩"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芩-20240814184544-zh7zf5d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 319px;\" parent-style=\"width: 329px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 430px;","style":"width: 420px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芩2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芩2-20240624172141-26gv8gc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 420px;\" parent-style=\"width: 430px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 248px;","style":"width: 238px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芩 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芩 6-20240814185137-6odvrty.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 238px;\" parent-style=\"width: 248px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814184630-30yh4fh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814184630-30yh4fh","updated":"20240814190146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芩 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芩 1-20240814184630-y6bkfq7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 554px;","style":"width: 544px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芩 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芩 12-20240814190146-ix47pw6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 544px;\" parent-style=\"width: 554px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814190131-mwero6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814190131-mwero6z","updated":"20240814190213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 518px;","style":"width: 508px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黄芩 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黄芩 13-20240814190213-jo6pto9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 508px;\" parent-style=\"width: 518px;\"}"},{"Type":"